WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.922
Hey Baron! Got a visitor.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:08.091
Cut the theatrics and get out here.

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:36.453
Welcome to the Cat Business Office.

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:41.249
Cool...

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:46.212
Our world overlaps
with yours, but it's different.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.631
Sometimes, when people create something...

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.551
and they put their heart into it...

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:55.263
their creation comes alive,
with its own soul.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:57.599
Like me. Like him.

00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:11.071
Oh my gosh!

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:13.656
This is Toto, our resident gargoyle.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:17.410
Baron, you rarely have visitors.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.913
She's rather charming, isn't she?

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:21.498
"Baron"?

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:25.251
I'm Baron Humbert von Gikkingen.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.254
My maker named me.

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:30.131
So you're Baron.

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:30.840
I heard about you.

